{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103420","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710342001:1":{"text":"꽥, 꽤애액! 꽥꽥. 꽥!","source_cn":"嘎！嘎！呜！咕！嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6838B7ACC5E169B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710342002:1":{"text":"이건... 로완의 애완 동물 아닌가요? 왜 혼자 여기 있는 걸까요? 게다가 이렇게나 놀란 모습이라니.","source_cn":"这是……罗万的那只宠物？它怎么会独自跑来这里？而且看起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D4D250497D46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710342003:1":{"text":"꽥꽥! 꽥. 꽤애애액!","source_cn":"嘎嘎！咕嘎！呜——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D30F18C67B60258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710342004:1":{"text":"뭔가 아주 중요한 말을 하고 싶은 것 같은데, 전혀 알아들을 수가 없어요...","source_cn":"它好像有很重要的话想对我们说，但我完全听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DC5DCD7D029504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710342005:1":{"text":"음음... 그렇게 된 일이었군...","source_cn":"嗯嗯……原来是这么回事啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A98544920DA3A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710342006:1":{"text":"쯧쯧쯧, 정말 눈 뜨고 봐줄 수가 없네.","source_cn":"啧啧啧，真是惨绝人寰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25CD25CED5F1BD0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710342007:1":{"text":"여우야, 얘가 무슨 말을 하는지 알아들을 수 있니? 우리에게 좀 전해줄 수 있을까?","source_cn":"小狐狸，你能听懂它想说什么吗？你能向我们转达一下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC051D288CC320B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710342008:1":{"text":"흥! 방금 전까지만 해도 나를 쫓아내려던 주제에...","source_cn":"哼，你们刚刚不是还联合起来想把我赶走嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x491C164A4CEFE4A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710342009:1":{"text":"쫓아내려던 건 아니고, 그게... 아무튼, 이렇게 부탁할게!","source_cn":"我们没有要赶你走的意思，只是……总之，先拜托了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F9FA53EB6128D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710342010:1":{"text":"다 내가 착한 여우라서 도와주는 거야. 고맙게 생각하라고!","source_cn":"好在我是只善良慷慨的狐狸，就大方帮你们转译一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9223FE3A6C789E02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710342011:1":{"text":"“큰일이야! 미스릴 상회가 파산했어. 로완이 전 재산을